    "style": "",
    "html": "<div class=\"c-text-block-wrapper o-module no-bottom-margin\">\n<div class=\"o-layout-container\">\n<div class=\"o-content c-text-block c-text-block--none\">\n<p>Families in remote areas are still waiting for treatment. Your support helps us reach them. In the image gallery below, you can meet some of the children in Zambia whose lives have been transformed by trachoma treatment – made possible thanks to the support of people like you.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
